01:22:05,580 --> 01:22:05,920
Hello.

1098
01:22:08,980 --> 01:22:09,880
Get out of here.

1099
01:22:13,620 --> 01:22:13,840
Nice.

1100
01:22:15,500 --> 01:22:19,480
Also, I should probably not have my chisel on, should I?

1101
01:22:21,200 --> 01:22:21,980
I probably should.

1102
01:22:22,860 --> 01:22:23,900
I'm doing a lot of digging.

1103
01:22:26,260 --> 01:22:27,160
What is this?

1104
01:22:28,300 --> 01:22:28,940
Oh, it's stone.

1105
01:22:29,580 --> 01:22:31,180
Why did it look like something else?

1106
01:22:38,230 --> 01:22:40,210
Just go further, further down.

1107
01:22:43,900 --> 01:22:45,520
Actually, I keep going the same route here.

1108
01:22:54,200 --> 01:22:54,740
What's that?

1109
01:22:55,560 --> 01:22:57,060
Ah, that's the thing I can't mine.

1110
01:22:58,880 --> 01:22:59,340
Ah, you know what?

1111
01:22:59,540 --> 01:23:02,740
I bet if I make a titanium pickaxe, I'll be able to do it.

1112
01:23:03,620 --> 01:23:05,000
That's like the next step, I think.

1113
01:23:08,480 --> 01:23:09,860
Am I seeing anything?

1114
01:23:10,580 --> 01:23:10,880
Hold on.

1115
01:23:11,580 --> 01:23:12,220
Any oars...

1116
01:23:13,380 --> 01:23:14,480
Actually, there's something red there.

1117
01:23:22,240 --> 01:23:24,820
Man, those projectiles they're shooting, I...

1118
01:23:24,820 --> 01:23:26,360
Fuck, it's insane.

1119
01:23:27,000 --> 01:23:29,760
You cannot see them, and they kill you.

1120
01:23:30,140 --> 01:23:31,420
Like, what am I getting hit by?

1121
01:23:31,720 --> 01:23:31,980
Hello?

1122
01:23:35,280 --> 01:23:36,220
What's hitting me?

1123
01:23:37,700 --> 01:23:40,540
I mean, I'm poisoned, but something else was hitting me just now.

1124
01:23:52,600 --> 01:23:53,220
Kill it.

1125
01:24:00,070 --> 01:24:01,050
Hate those guys.

1126
01:24:04,820 --> 01:24:06,140
Wait a minute, is that a trap over there?

1127
01:24:06,280 --> 01:24:06,580
What's that?

1128
01:24:07,880 --> 01:24:09,500
Oh, it's dynamite!

1129
01:24:11,500 --> 01:24:12,500
It's Dunamit.

1130
01:24:14,080 --> 01:24:15,040
I see you.

1131
01:24:15,220 --> 01:24:15,580
Fuck off.

1132
01:24:25,690 --> 01:24:26,290
Satisfying.

1133
01:24:26,690 --> 01:24:27,650
Who sets up these things?

1134
01:24:30,770 --> 01:24:31,790
That's what I want to know.

1135
01:24:34,200 --> 01:24:34,860
Okay, he's dead.

1136
01:24:35,140 --> 01:24:35,420
That's nice.

1137
01:24:36,540 --> 01:24:37,100
What is that?

1138
01:24:38,240 --> 01:24:39,140
A king statue?

1139
01:24:45,970 --> 01:24:46,410
Deleted.

1140
01:24:48,230 --> 01:24:49,430
Somebody wants statues.

1141
01:24:51,350 --> 01:24:53,050
But there's so many of these statues as well.

1142
01:24:53,910 --> 01:24:57,610
I feel like there's got to be something more to it, other than just...

1143
01:24:59,430 --> 01:25:01,750
They spawn certain enemies after a time.

1144
01:25:03,990 --> 01:25:06,290
And honestly, it does seem a little inconsistent as well.

1145
01:25:06,710 --> 01:25:10,370
Like, some of them do, some of them don't in a way.

1146
01:25:11,210 --> 01:25:13,130
Like, where nothing happens at all, it's a little bit weird.

1147
01:25:17,060 --> 01:25:17,940
Look at that!

1148
01:25:18,640 --> 01:25:19,040
Geometry.

1149
01:25:23,150 --> 01:25:23,950
Is he Orykalko?

1150
01:25:23,950 --> 01:25:24,030
Oh,

1151
01:25:31,390 --> 01:25:32,270
you've gone burned.

1152
01:25:34,690 --> 01:25:36,210
Oh, it doesn't have a lot of range, actually.

1153
01:25:36,410 --> 01:25:37,530
Like, it drops off quite...

1154
01:25:38,450 --> 01:25:39,430
Doesn't go very high, does it?

1155
01:25:40,850 --> 01:25:42,070
That's the limitation on that.

1156
01:25:43,690 --> 01:25:45,210
What the hell is that thing?

1157
01:25:53,090 --> 01:25:54,130
What was that just now?

1158
01:25:55,270 --> 01:25:55,570
Whoops!

1159
01:26:01,010 --> 01:26:01,770
Ah, come on!

1160
01:26:02,690 --> 01:26:03,290
There we go.

1161
01:26:05,730 --> 01:26:07,190
In fact, I have a lot of bombs.

1162
01:26:08,130 --> 01:26:08,990
Ah, these fucking guys.

1163
01:26:13,660 --> 01:26:14,220
Oh, no.

1164
01:26:26,660 --> 01:26:30,360
Okay, don't use this item in two tight quarters, otherwise it's terrible.

1165
01:26:32,180 --> 01:26:33,000
How we doing?

1166
01:26:34,840 --> 01:26:36,340
I think we're okay here.

1167
01:26:38,520 --> 01:26:38,900
Gimme.

1168
01:26:39,800 --> 01:26:41,540
Let me actually open this.

1169
01:26:43,120 --> 01:26:43,780
Put in my money.

1170
01:26:45,380 --> 01:26:45,940
So the...

1171
01:26:45,940 --> 01:26:46,920
Actually, I don't have that many bombs.

1172
01:26:56,210 --> 01:26:57,440
Just bomb the shit out of it.

1173
01:26:59,340 --> 01:26:59,900
Oof.

1174
01:27:05,250 --> 01:27:06,310
Ah, the projectiles.

1175
01:27:07,230 --> 01:27:07,630
Oh, no.

1176
01:27:11,330 --> 01:27:11,510
Hey.

1177
01:27:13,330 --> 01:27:14,810
I need to find the angle here.

1178
01:27:15,990 --> 01:27:16,390
There we go.

1179
01:27:19,690 --> 01:27:21,650
Look how much HP they have.

1180
01:27:23,670 --> 01:27:24,230
Why?

1181
01:27:25,750 --> 01:27:27,150
Why is it so extreme?

1182
01:27:27,430 --> 01:27:28,970
Like, what's with the jump here?

1183
01:27:29,970 --> 01:27:30,590
In HP?

1184
01:27:30,850 --> 01:27:31,570
They went from, like...

1185
01:27:32,370 --> 01:27:36,290
Having no HP to being insane bullet sponges.

1186
01:27:37,150 --> 01:27:37,670
Like, what?

1187
01:27:39,690 --> 01:27:41,170
And I'm dying to small projectiles.

1188
01:27:41,390 --> 01:27:41,890
I can't see!

1189
01:27:42,990 --> 01:27:43,870
Fucking kill it quick.

1190
01:27:46,010 --> 01:27:46,730
Come on.

1191
01:27:48,190 --> 01:27:49,190
I can't get that in there.

1192
01:27:49,390 --> 01:27:50,290
Ah, this sorta works.

1193
01:27:50,850 --> 01:27:51,070
You know what?

1194
01:27:51,210 --> 01:27:51,450
Fuck them.

1195
01:27:51,570 --> 01:27:52,330
I don't have to fight you.

1196
01:27:53,090 --> 01:27:54,070
I'm going my own path.

1197
01:27:55,450 --> 01:27:55,690
Whoop!

1198
01:27:56,550 --> 01:27:56,990
Okay.

1199
01:27:57,490 --> 01:27:58,110
We made it.

1200
01:27:59,310 --> 01:28:00,170
We are here.

1201
01:28:01,570 --> 01:28:03,870
But something tells me I shouldn't go down just yet.

1202
01:28:03,970 --> 01:28:04,410
I need to heal.

1203
01:28:08,670 --> 01:28:10,950
Let me quickly put on Obsidian Skin.

1204
01:28:12,330 --> 01:28:12,730
Uh-oh.

1205
01:28:14,890 --> 01:28:16,850
These guys have no HP at all.

1206
01:28:17,770 --> 01:28:17,990
What?

1207
01:28:18,230 --> 01:28:20,090
I expected these guys to be insane now.

1208
01:28:21,770 --> 01:28:22,610
You saw that?

1209
01:28:22,690 --> 01:28:23,370
They instantly died.

1210
01:28:25,850 --> 01:28:26,270
Oh!

1211
01:28:27,270 --> 01:28:28,350
Fireball out of nowhere.

1212
01:28:28,850 --> 01:28:29,290
Off screen.

1213
01:28:30,390 --> 01:28:30,950
That's nice.

1214
01:28:35,830 --> 01:28:36,570
Gotta go back.

1215
01:28:37,350 --> 01:28:40,010
Good thing I just put all my gold in my piggy bank.

1216
01:28:42,970 --> 01:28:43,190
Look at this.

1217
01:28:43,550 --> 01:28:44,970
In instant clean inventory.

1218
01:28:46,090 --> 01:28:47,670
Is that just not the best thing ever?

1219
01:28:48,450 --> 01:28:48,890
Look at this.

1220
01:28:49,310 --> 01:28:50,310
Already ready to go.

1221
01:28:50,750 --> 01:28:51,590
How is that not incredible?

1222
01:28:55,800 --> 01:28:56,360
There we go.

1223
01:29:00,570 --> 01:29:02,010
I'm gonna speedrun through this section.

1224
01:29:08,070 --> 01:29:08,450
Speedrun.

1225
01:29:17,740 --> 01:29:19,400
I'm just going to the same path I went before.

1226
01:29:22,450 --> 01:29:25,150
Kind of a weird path I took, but whatever.

1227
01:29:27,110 --> 01:29:28,510
Like, look at these small projectiles.

1228
01:29:29,170 --> 01:29:30,630
You almost can't see them.

1229
01:29:31,130 --> 01:29:33,410
And they take like one third of your HP.

1230
01:29:33,970 --> 01:29:35,550
And they shoot them so frequently.

1231
01:29:37,150 --> 01:29:38,750
It is the most insane enemy ever.

1232
01:29:41,270 --> 01:29:43,510
The hardest enemy in the game, probably.

1233
01:29:48,190 --> 01:29:48,970
There you go.

1234
01:29:50,390 --> 01:29:51,550
One at a time I can handle.

1235
01:29:53,530 --> 01:29:53,670
Oh!

1236
01:29:55,650 --> 01:29:56,370
Fire Imp.

1237
01:29:59,330 --> 01:30:00,610
Wait, why is that here?

1238
01:30:03,330 --> 01:30:04,770
Oh, don't even think about it.

1239
01:30:13,000 --> 01:30:14,380
Okay, we made it.

1240
01:30:14,560 --> 01:30:14,860
Ah!

1241
01:30:15,360 --> 01:30:18,140
No, hold on, there's a fucking turtle on us.

1242
01:30:27,810 --> 01:30:28,730
Okay, I need to heal.

1243
01:30:31,800 --> 01:30:32,660
Go in here and hide.

1244
01:30:35,460 --> 01:30:37,420
Okay, nothing will hit me now, right?

1245
01:30:38,460 --> 01:30:39,060
We're safe.

1246
01:30:40,080 --> 01:30:42,360
I'm just throwing bombs out there, just for good measure.

1247
01:30:43,580 --> 01:30:44,700
Gotta get rid of them anyway.

1248
01:30:45,200 --> 01:30:46,080
We got a guy up there.

1249
01:30:47,620 --> 01:30:47,980
Could I?

1250
01:30:50,800 --> 01:30:52,480
Ah, they don't have enough bounce power.

1251
01:30:53,820 --> 01:30:55,660
Okay, I'm sort of gaining some HP here.

1252
01:30:56,360 --> 01:30:57,200
Obsidian skin now.

1253
01:30:59,160 --> 01:30:59,860
There we go.

1254
01:31:00,600 --> 01:31:01,760
And let's also go with...

1255
01:31:05,880 --> 01:31:06,220
Thorns.

1256
01:31:07,600 --> 01:31:07,960
Why not?

1257
01:31:08,480 --> 01:31:09,300
Let's go vid...

1258
01:31:09,300 --> 01:31:10,400
Nah, not invisibility.

1259
01:31:11,640 --> 01:31:12,200
Magic power.

1260
01:31:14,440 --> 01:31:16,440
So that should do... how much now?

1261
01:31:32,990 --> 01:31:34,350
Uh-oh, it's the protectile people.

1262
01:31:37,630 --> 01:31:38,230
Just...

1263
01:31:38,230 --> 01:31:39,450
Oh, look at the small protectiles!

1264
01:31:41,550 --> 01:31:42,690
Why are they here?

1265
01:31:43,030 --> 01:31:43,790
Oh my god!

1266
01:31:45,830 --> 01:31:46,190
Oh!

1267
01:31:53,710 --> 01:31:55,250
Bro, what is this enemy?

1268
01:31:57,510 --> 01:31:58,150
Hello?

1269
01:32:00,050 --> 01:32:01,410
Stop following me!

1270
01:32:03,210 --> 01:32:04,210
I want peace!

1271
01:32:05,530 --> 01:32:06,850
Leave me alone, dammit!

1272
01:32:12,550 --> 01:32:14,290
Why are things so easy to kill down here?

1273
01:32:14,710 --> 01:32:16,950
I mean, not the bees, of course, or the hornets, or whatever.

1274
01:32:18,530 --> 01:32:19,770
Like the other guys down here.

1275
01:32:23,310 --> 01:32:24,890
Actually, hold on, I wanna try and fish here.

1276
01:32:25,790 --> 01:32:27,370
It's probably gonna be really dumb, but...

1277
01:32:29,170 --> 01:32:29,970
I gotta try it.

1278
01:32:34,560 --> 01:32:35,680
It actually works?

1279
01:32:40,390 --> 01:32:40,850
Or what?

1280
01:32:46,670 --> 01:32:47,310
Wait a bit.

1281
01:32:48,710 --> 01:32:50,590
Oh, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

1282
01:32:50,630 --> 01:32:51,070
Nevermind.

1283
01:32:53,930 --> 01:32:58,930
Oh, I need to be careful not accidentally killing one of those guys with the doll attached.

1284
01:33:02,660 --> 01:33:03,720
Let's quickly chest again.

1285
01:33:04,560 --> 01:33:06,460
We got a guy incoming.

1286
01:33:07,000 --> 01:33:07,260
We're fine.

1287
01:33:10,650 --> 01:33:11,770
Is this gonna do anything?

1288
01:33:21,330 --> 01:33:22,450
I don't think so.

1289
01:33:26,140 --> 01:33:27,440
Yeah, I don't think it's doing anything.

1290
01:33:29,160 --> 01:33:30,560
Like, these guys are so easy to kill!

1291
01:33:33,990 --> 01:33:39,570
I would have thought this place would be even harder, but apparently it's not.

1292
01:33:40,030 --> 01:33:40,990
What was this again?

1293
01:33:41,990 --> 01:33:42,410
Oh, Hellstone.

1294
01:33:43,650 --> 01:33:44,650
I'll take a bit of that, I guess.

1295
01:33:47,550 --> 01:33:48,170
Why not?

1296
01:33:49,930 --> 01:33:51,470
Got a pot over here.

1297
01:33:56,370 --> 01:33:57,810
Whoops, didn't mean to go all the way down there.

1298
01:34:00,370 --> 01:34:01,650
Okay, I don't think there's anything...

1299
01:34:01,650 --> 01:34:03,470
I mean, I already looted all the chests down here.

1300
01:34:06,210 --> 01:34:07,630
Actually, hold on, have I been to the...

1301
01:34:07,630 --> 01:34:08,810
I haven't even been to the right end.

1302
01:34:09,030 --> 01:34:12,410
Let's go all the way to the right, just to have it explored, you know?

1303
01:34:13,670 --> 01:34:15,930
Like, from a completionist point of view here.

1304
01:34:19,430 --> 01:34:20,490
Am I hitting anything?

1305
01:34:25,790 --> 01:34:27,930
Oh, look, it's also here.

1306
01:34:30,310 --> 01:34:30,910
Cobalt, thank you.

1307
01:34:36,630 --> 01:34:38,030
I wonder if there's titanium down here.

1308
01:34:41,560 --> 01:34:43,140
That's actually what I'm here for.

1309
01:34:43,780 --> 01:34:45,120
That was the goal of the expedition.

1310
01:34:52,540 --> 01:34:53,500
Give me a loan.

1311
01:34:57,820 --> 01:34:57,860
Nice.

1312
01:35:03,530 --> 01:35:04,490
Yeah, now we reach the end.

1313
01:35:07,010 --> 01:35:07,790
Is there anything down here?

1314
01:35:07,910 --> 01:35:08,690
It's just lava, okay.

1315
01:35:11,070 --> 01:35:11,510
All right.

1316
01:35:12,610 --> 01:35:16,070
Well, we have been all the way to the west and all the way to the east now.

1317
01:35:17,830 --> 01:35:19,630
We have confirmed there is nothing there.

1318
01:35:25,240 --> 01:35:27,720
Man, these things they're shooting are actually dangerous.

1319
01:35:35,920 --> 01:35:36,500
Let me go up here.

1320
01:35:37,600 --> 01:35:38,580
Ah, here we go.

1321
01:35:38,960 --> 01:35:41,120
Ori, Calcum, and a lot of it.

1322
01:35:42,840 --> 01:35:43,180
Beautiful.

1323
01:35:57,470 --> 01:35:58,010
There we go.

1324
01:36:03,920 --> 01:36:04,860
Where should I go next?

1325
01:36:07,960 --> 01:36:08,320
Whoops.

1326
01:36:16,070 --> 01:36:17,430
I don't know if I want to go...

1327
01:36:18,950 --> 01:36:23,810
Man, I can't even have like two seconds to open the map here before I get attacked again.

1328
01:36:24,810 --> 01:36:25,930
Okay, quickly out.

1329
01:36:27,330 --> 01:36:28,350
Let's go somewhere else.

1330
01:36:29,410 --> 01:36:30,270
That wasn't that cool.

1331
01:36:30,270 --> 01:36:31,460
In fact, I want to go back to...

1332
01:36:34,030 --> 01:36:34,890
Where was it?

1333
01:36:36,310 --> 01:36:38,410
This place right here with the unicorn.

1334
01:36:39,830 --> 01:36:40,830
I want to check that out again.

1335
01:36:41,670 --> 01:36:42,890
Wait, a bone serpent kite.

1336
01:36:53,390 --> 01:36:55,550
Oh, on windy days, I see.

1337
01:36:59,510 --> 01:37:01,410
All right, look at that.

1338
01:37:03,850 --> 01:37:05,050
Pretty cool, I guess.

1339
01:37:06,250 --> 01:37:06,830
A werewolf.

1340
01:37:10,550 --> 01:37:12,070
How do you liken the flames?

1341
01:37:14,610 --> 01:37:15,590
Honestly, hello?

1342
01:37:15,890 --> 01:37:22,070
These things could be nice against the wave event, where they come in waves.

1343
01:37:24,530 --> 01:37:26,300
It's a little hard to aim with, though.

1344
01:37:27,990 --> 01:37:29,170
Against flying things.

1345
01:37:33,420 --> 01:37:33,880
That's fine.

1346
01:37:35,960 --> 01:37:40,320
All right, let's put this in the weird box, miscellaneous.

1347
01:37:41,460 --> 01:37:43,160
Ash grass seeds.

1348
01:37:44,680 --> 01:37:45,500
That's new.

1349
01:37:46,340 --> 01:37:47,020
Put it in here.

1350
01:37:49,240 --> 01:37:52,420
And look at this inventory, still completely clean.

1351
01:37:53,160 --> 01:37:53,640
Squeaky clean.

1352
01:37:55,520 --> 01:37:58,220
I'm so happy I went through the ordeal.

1353
01:38:00,240 --> 01:38:02,620
And fixed up the whole management last time.

1354
01:38:11,200 --> 01:38:12,400
Hold on.

1355
01:38:13,240 --> 01:38:13,520
Wait a minute.

1356
01:38:15,680 --> 01:38:16,920
What is going on here?

1357
01:38:23,590 --> 01:38:28,410
Why is this all shit right now?

1358
01:38:30,250 --> 01:38:31,030
What the fuck?

1359
01:38:33,940 --> 01:38:35,000
This shit is spreading.

1360
01:38:39,010 --> 01:38:41,290
That's why there are these goddamn enemies here.

1361
01:38:41,830 --> 01:38:43,370
I was wondering why these were here.

1362
01:38:44,730 --> 01:38:45,050
Hello?

1363
01:38:46,370 --> 01:38:47,450
Will you get out?

1364
01:38:49,170 --> 01:38:50,450
Excuse me.

1365
01:38:51,170 --> 01:38:52,050
Yeah, you like that?

1366
01:38:52,150 --> 01:38:52,510
You like that?

1367
01:38:53,130 --> 01:38:53,670
Look at this.

1368
01:38:53,710 --> 01:38:55,070
This is actually great for this sort of thing.

1369
