3258
03:30:21,470 --> 03:30:22,410
But it's so good, though.

3259
03:30:22,470 --> 03:30:23,510
It's such a good job.

3260
03:30:23,990 --> 03:30:25,410
It's the best job ever.

3261
03:30:26,630 --> 03:30:27,430
Kata is coming soon.

3262
03:30:27,610 --> 03:30:28,490
Ah, okay.

3263
03:30:28,850 --> 03:30:29,030
Yeah.

3264
03:30:31,590 --> 03:30:32,230
I see.

3265
03:30:32,750 --> 03:30:34,210
But do you really want to play Kata, though?

3266
03:30:35,210 --> 03:30:35,670
Like, really?

3267
03:30:36,970 --> 03:30:39,730
Isn't that why Classic was invented to begin with?

3268
03:30:40,010 --> 03:30:41,570
Because it started going downhill from there?

3269
03:30:42,290 --> 03:30:43,710
But maybe it's like different because...

3270
03:30:43,710 --> 03:30:51,410
It's about all the people starting together again, and it's the rush of, you know, starting over, you know?

3271
03:30:52,110 --> 03:30:53,550
I guess that's the fun part.

3272
03:30:57,950 --> 03:31:00,490
Are you pre-recording on the non-stream Let's Plays?

3273
03:31:02,010 --> 03:31:03,190
Am I pre-recording?

3274
03:31:05,870 --> 03:31:06,930
I don't know what you mean.

3275
03:31:08,010 --> 03:31:09,010
I am recording them.

3276
03:31:10,890 --> 03:31:11,430
Yeah.

3277
03:31:12,130 --> 03:31:13,030
I am recording...

3278
03:31:13,030 --> 03:31:14,370
I mean, oh, I think...

3279
03:31:14,370 --> 03:31:17,650
Yeah, I record quite a long time ahead.

3280
03:31:18,450 --> 03:31:21,910
So I have a bank of stuff to upload on the days where I can't play games.

3281
03:31:22,150 --> 03:31:25,970
I have frequent times when I can't play anything for a good chunk of time.

3282
03:31:26,690 --> 03:31:29,310
So then I have a library of stuff I can put up in the meanwhile.

3283
03:31:30,890 --> 03:31:31,650
Ah, yes, yes.

3284
03:31:32,010 --> 03:31:32,290
Hippogree.

3285
03:31:32,770 --> 03:31:33,830
Yes, the answer is yes.

3286
03:31:34,530 --> 03:31:34,890
I do.

3287
03:31:35,970 --> 03:31:37,030
They caught me at a weak moment.

3288
03:31:37,170 --> 03:31:39,450
I was bored and now I'm leveling my 19th character.

3289
03:31:39,670 --> 03:31:40,390
You know how it is.

3290
03:31:41,710 --> 03:31:42,030
Yeah.

3291
03:31:43,670 --> 03:31:46,510
Man, I just want classic again.

3292
03:31:46,710 --> 03:31:47,570
Like, let's start over.

3293
03:31:47,950 --> 03:31:49,170
Let's go again, you know?

3294
03:31:50,190 --> 03:31:50,770
Vanilla again.

3295
03:31:51,770 --> 03:31:52,530
One more time.

3296
03:31:52,690 --> 03:31:53,370
One more time.

3297
03:31:53,530 --> 03:31:54,310
From the very beginning.

3298
03:31:56,930 --> 03:31:57,950
That's what I want.

3299
03:31:59,950 --> 03:32:00,690
Start over.

3300
03:32:03,210 --> 03:32:04,010
Fresh, exactly.

3301
03:32:08,810 --> 03:32:11,250
Super sunk cost, fallacy, and shadow lands for me.

3302
03:32:12,330 --> 03:32:14,410
I actually never played shadow lands, I think.

3303
03:32:15,470 --> 03:32:16,190
Maybe I did.

3304
03:32:16,790 --> 03:32:19,090
But very shortly, it was like, nah, that's not for me.

3305
03:32:21,190 --> 03:32:22,350
When will Oliver play Noiter?

3306
03:32:22,530 --> 03:32:23,350
I need my Noiter fix.

3307
03:32:24,830 --> 03:32:25,410
Probably someday.

3308
03:32:26,390 --> 03:32:26,950
Someday soon, maybe.

3309
03:32:28,250 --> 03:32:28,790
New to Terraria?

3310
03:32:29,270 --> 03:32:29,650
Yes, Eclipse.

3311
03:32:30,770 --> 03:32:31,830
This is my...

3312
03:32:31,830 --> 03:32:33,490
Actually, I think I'm at 60 hours or something.

3313
03:32:34,010 --> 03:32:36,490
But I still feel like quite the noob in this game.

3314
03:32:52,290 --> 03:32:54,290
I need Noiter injected into my abdomen.

3315
03:32:55,110 --> 03:32:57,250
Ha ha ha ha ha!

3316
03:32:58,430 --> 03:32:58,930
Okay.

3317
03:33:01,510 --> 03:33:06,410
Well, it is your birthday, so I think you're allowed to do that sort of thing.

3318
03:33:08,330 --> 03:33:09,450
Did someone say fresh?

3319
03:33:10,430 --> 03:33:10,850
I don't know.

3320
03:33:11,430 --> 03:33:12,370
Did someone say fresh?

3321
03:33:13,870 --> 03:33:14,490
I think so.

3322
03:33:16,430 --> 03:33:20,550
Yeah, everybody wish Hive a happy birthday.

3323
03:33:24,310 --> 03:33:26,590
Well, I gotta go, dinner's ready, see y'all, have a good day.

3324
03:33:26,790 --> 03:33:28,690
Yeah, the Lord Eternal, I'll see you next time.

3325
03:33:29,710 --> 03:33:30,910
You better be there next time.

3326
03:33:31,450 --> 03:33:36,230
Or else, I will appear in front of your window with an industrial grade printer.

3327
03:33:41,560 --> 03:33:42,380
Okay, I'm out of here.

3328
03:33:43,820 --> 03:33:44,880
Thanks for stopping by, everybody.

3329
03:33:45,560 --> 03:33:45,640
Boots!

3330
03:33:46,420 --> 03:33:47,120
Good to see you, man.

3331
03:33:47,960 --> 03:33:49,600
We gotta play some games soon.

3332
03:33:50,980 --> 03:33:51,220
Anything.

3333
03:33:53,760 --> 03:33:54,420
Alright, bye-bye.

